      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Obesity is a worldwide health problem leading to a range of health consequences. This review summarizes the known effects of obesity on the musculoskeletal system. Specifically, the effects of obesity on the shoulders, spine, knees, feet and other areas related to sports medicine are examined."},
